#: scenario6:scenario6_2A3AC17A_E894_4E74_BCFF_D6E41BE5D3FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13d3a791acfb1ca63300978afa07e6946b83170a13dd9249bf16c931acfac81d
