msgid "⟪k:0⟫But it’s hard to deny when that very witch is talking to you right this moment."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais c’est difficile de le nier quand la sorcière en personne est en train de te parler."

#: scenario6:scenario6_08DAF539_38A4_447E_8958_EC0C0D945E67
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f6a0f64ece82e5a043b093e7798884d10ae79c4665b7b5c95d2850ff32ca7ed
